{
  "schema": 1,
  "description": "ASSET-220: every behaviour the spark-cli README and the Game Packaging wiki page advertise, with the commands and options it concerns and the tests that prove it. Python tests are unittest ids under Tools/spark-cli/tests; names without a dot are SparkTests TEST names. Checked by Tools/spark-cli/tests/test_spark_cli_claims.py (CTest CLI_ClaimsMatchBehavior).",
  "claims": [
    {
